ck\":\"i was late to my job because the clinic didnt honor my appointment schedule\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"i dont think the clinic checks their online booking system as they never respond to my requests\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"i couldnt book an appointment on my because the ui was not optimized\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"hindi efficient ang pag book online\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"the clinic charges a premium so we can call it overpriced\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"no one picked up the phone when I called multiple times for assistance which is unacceptable\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"its frustrating that i cant book multiple pets in one appointment\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"out of the many times we have gone here not once did we get to have our appointment on time\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"i was shocked at how much they charged me for a simple procedure\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"i dont understand why it takes so long for them to finish an appointment\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"mahirap magbook online at nauubos ang oras\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"absolutely awful i came to check on the grooming process and the area was freezing my poor girl was shaking\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"we are often unable to book a schedule here\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"the receptionist was on their phone instead of helping customers which is rude\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"the clinic staff seemed unorganized and lost my appointment booking\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"you have to wait for a long time despite having a schedule\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"hindi matulungin ang mga tauhan sa pag book\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"i couldnt leave a note during the booking process which is not good\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"our appointment got delayed and we had to wait forever which is ridiculous\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"sobrang bagal ng booking process kaya hindi katanggap tanggap\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"},{\"feedback\":\"hindi user friendly ang pag book online at nakakaasar lang\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-17 00:00:00\"}]', '2025-04-21 08:25:50', '2025-04-21 08:25:50');

